WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.627
The same job, on three boards.

2
00:00:02.627 --> 00:00:05.600
Job Radar merges them into
one and keeps every link.

3
00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:11.691
It reads the facts that matter: remote or
hybrid, the contract, the German level.

4
00:00:11.691 --> 00:00:13.830
Agencies and closed postings are marked.

5
00:00:14.895 --> 00:00:17.517
Your filters do the rest,
and nothing just vanishes.

6
00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.015
You can always see why.
